        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Apap kangjang khou ruina",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Apap kangjang khou ruina ata kanloumei puta,",
            "Sauhpirun 8#@ runlou lana;",
            "Jeimiu jeihang patna jai the, amuh daimei kaikhou,",
            "Rianra rianriu khangna theilou the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He tingkauh Gwangde rianra rianriu khangmei,",
            "Israel le kandih gwang daimei nun8#@ rui,",
            "Thai e thei thuaihianmei Poubauhmei ta",
            "Kross ru khou thou rui suluai nina cho?",
            "",
            "2. Meinun rui phu e,suluai khang kandih kaguang kaikhou,",
            "Tingkauh guangh rianrana khum kei;",
            "Pap phungmei nun khang 8#@rui kross rukhou theilou",
            "kanthe,",
            "Houmu meinun ruina Hojam kao e.",
            "",
            "3. He tingkau tingthin kei o, tingkau kaguang khum lakhang,",
            "Meinun rui kap pui lu suan diu;",
            "Dui kumma mikdui rui luang diu, banglani jai kandiu,",
            "Tingkauh kaguang ruina thei lou pui nung.",
            "",
            "4. Pap le theimei ta ngam lana, thao dat kanthe pou 8#@,",
            "Theimei khou rui rianramei guai;",
            "Kanloumei pu pan rui ringthao dat lana neilana,",
            "Ringhpiu ram namdai gaimei khou gut the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
